      "notes": "Cobb County (Marietta seat, pop. 766,000; Atlanta metro northwest) maintains a Tax Assessor parcel layer at gis.cobbcounty.org that refreshes nightly from CAMA data -- the service name 'taxassessorsdaily' reflects this cadence. 36+ confirmed fields: PIN, PARID, PARCEL_TYPE, OWNER_NAM1/2 (owner names), SITUS_ADDR (site address), OWNER_ADDR/CITY/STAT/ZIP (owner mailing address), TAXDIST, ACRES, FMV_LAND (fair-market land value), FMV_BLDG, FMV_TOTAL, ASV_LAND (assessed land), ASV_BLDG, ASV_TOTAL, CLASS (property class), NBHOOD_NUM (neighborhood code). Verified 2026-05-15: SMITH returns results from Acworth, Marietta, Powder Springs, and Kennesaw. Cobb County borders Atlanta only in limited segments and has no parcel-boundary overlap with the city. The county's GIS Hub at geo-cobbcountyga.hub.arcgis.com and the Property Search portal at gis.cobbcounty.org/PropertySearch.html both provide web-interface access. The Cobb County Board of Tax Assessors (cobbassessor.org) is the authoritative record for appeals, exemptions, and recent reassessment values."
