      "notes": "Gwinnett County (pop. ~975,000; Lawrenceville seat; Atlanta metro northeast, Georgia's second-most-populous county) publishes a Property_and_Tax FeatureServer. IMPORTANT: owner data lives on LAYER 3 (the 'Tax Master Table', a non-spatial Table with 35 fields including OWNER1, OWNER2, PIN, LOCADDR, LOCCITY, LOCZIP), NOT on layer 0, which is the parcel geometry layer carrying PIN but no owner name. Query layer 3 for owner-name search; join to layer 0 on PIN if geometry is needed. Verified 2026-06-20: layer 3 holds 314,998 records; UPPER(OWNER1) LIKE '%SMITH%' returns real owners with Duluth/Norcross addresses and ZIPs (e.g. '4078 STILLWATER DR, DULUTH 30096'). Because layer 3 is a Table, query results return no geometry. Cities within the county include Lawrenceville, Duluth, Norcross, Snellville, Suwanee, Lilburn, Buford, Sugar Hill, Grayson, Loganville, Berkeley Lake, Dacula, Auburn, Braselton, Peachtree Corners. For authoritative assessment/appeal records use the Gwinnett County Tax Assessor's office."
